#: src/postulo/plugins/esco/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "ESCO occupations and skills"
msgstr "Professiuns e cumpetenzas ESCO"

#: src/postulo/plugins/esco/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Suggests job titles from ESCO, the European classification of occupations, in your language, and recognises the skills you record against ESCO's list of skills. It reads files an administrator downloads once with manage.py fetch_esco and asks no service while you work. Switched off, the title and skill boxes are plain and every code and skill already kept stays as it is."
msgstr "Propona titels da professiun or d'ESCO, la classificaziun europeica da las professiuns, en tia lingua e renconuscha las cumpetenzas che ti registrescas tenor la glista da cumpetenzas d'ESCO. Ella legia datotecas che in administratur chargia giu ina suletta giada cun manage.py fetch_esco e na dumonda nagin servetsch durant che ti lavuras. Sch'ella è deactivada, èn las chaschas per il titel e las cumpetenzas simplas e mintga code e mintga cumpetenza gia memorisads restan sco ch'els èn."
